bound-lock/1 about="Research status: experiment in the explicitly supplied finite sample. The historical descriptive text below is not a universal or physical theorem; general extrapolation remains open. spending a budget where the premium is highest closes more than spending it blindly, and provoking the disagreement closes more still and names coordinates that were not there" at=policy:law/T27 by=target form=alphabet kind=conjecture measure=status needs=samples/yes/T27-disagreement-can-be-provoked.json|test/laws.test.ts restsOn=law/T2-coordinate-where-disagree|law/A7-freedom-conserved|law/A5-origin-is-extension role=demands scope=law/T27-disagreement-can-be-provoked value=present view=field
